WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.017
Most useful data-processing code combines repetition with a decision inside the loop.

00:00:06.017 --> 00:00:08.922
The loop takes one sale at a time.

00:00:08.922 --> 00:00:13.357
The if statement checks whether that sale is at least one thousand.

00:00:13.357 --> 00:00:17.743
Each value is then labeled as either target met or below target.

00:00:18.405 --> 00:00:24.487
This is a classic classification pattern: iterate over records, apply the same rule,

00:00:24.487 --> 00:00:27.469
and produce a category for each observation.
